<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<main class="legal-page">
  <p class="legal-label">StaySphere</p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: October 24, 2026</p>

  <section>
    <h2>About this project</h2>
    <p>
      StaySphere is an educational portfolio project. It demonstrates a travel
      listing platform and does not process real reservations or payments.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Information we store</h2>
    <p>
      When you create an account, we store your username and email address.
      Passwords are stored as a secure hash, not as readable text. We also store
      listings and reviews that you choose to submit.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How information is used</h2>
    <p>
      This information is used only to provide account access, display listings,
      and support reviews and ownership features within StaySphere.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Services used</h2>
    <p>
      StaySphere uses MongoDB Atlas for application data, Cloudinary for uploaded
      images, Mapbox for maps, and Render for hosting. These services may process
      technical information needed to provide their features.
    </p>
  </section>

  <a href="/listings" class="legal-back-link">Back to listings</a>
</main>
